                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq [grid-column-gap:10px] [grid-row-gap:10px] [flex-flow:column] [padding-bottom:16px] [display:flex]">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 [letter-spacing:.2px] [white-space:normal] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [opacity:.8] [pointer-events:auto] [text-wrap:balance] max-landscape:[font-size:13px] max-lg:[font-size:13px]">Almost always the flagship explainer. It&#x27;s the one video that works everywhere at once, on your homepage, at the start of every sales deck, and cut down for social and paid. Most teams get more from one excellent explainer than from three average videos, and everything else can build from it later.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a7" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown [display:inline-block] [position:relative] [text-align:left] [margin-left:auto] [margin-right:auto] [z-index:900] [cursor:pointer] [background-image:linear-gradient(75deg,_#0a0814b3,_#140d24b3)] [border:1px_solid_#ffffff1a] [border-radius:25px] [width:100%] [padding-left:20px] [padding-right:20px] max-sm:[z-index:1]">
