                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq [grid-column-gap:10px] [grid-row-gap:10px] [flex-flow:column] [padding-bottom:16px] [display:flex]">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 [letter-spacing:.2px] [white-space:normal] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [opacity:.8] [pointer-events:auto] [text-wrap:balance] max-landscape:[font-size:13px] max-lg:[font-size:13px]">Yes. The funding labels are shorthand for situations, not requirements. Series A here really means one small team carrying a launch, Series B means shipping faster than your content can keep up, and Series C means keeping many videos consistent at once. Tell us which of those sounds like your week and we&#x27;ll work from there, whether you&#x27;ve raised or not.</p>
