                  <p class="text-14-150 [letter-spacing:.2px] [white-space:normal] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] max-landscape:[font-size:13px]">Our product ships every few weeks. How do you keep up?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq [width:20px] [min-width:20px] [height:20px] [min-height:20px] max-sm:[min-width:2rem]" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
