                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq [grid-column-gap:10px] [grid-row-gap:10px] [flex-flow:column] [padding-bottom:16px] [display:flex]">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 [letter-spacing:.2px] [white-space:normal] [margin-bottom:0] [font-family:Switzer,_sans-serif] [font-size:14px] [font-weight:400] [line-height:150%] [opacity:.8] [pointer-events:auto] [text-wrap:balance] max-landscape:[font-size:13px] max-lg:[font-size:13px]">By not starting from zero each time. On a subscription we already know your brand, your product, and your standards, so a new feature video starts from a brief, not a re-introduction. The reusable asset library we build along the way makes each video faster than the one before it.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown [display:inline-block] [position:relative] [text-align:left] [margin-left:auto] [margin-right:auto] [z-index:900] [cursor:pointer] [background-image:linear-gradient(75deg,_#0a0814b3,_#140d24b3)] [border:1px_solid_#ffffff1a] [border-radius:25px] [width:100%] [padding-left:20px] [padding-right:20px] max-sm:[z-index:1]">
